==Pre-match==
[[File:2020 UEL Final identity.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Original identity of the 2020 UEFA Europa League Final]]

===Identity===
The original identity of the 2020 UEFA Europa League Final was unveiled at the group stage draw on 30 August 2019.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.uefa.com/news-media/news/0254-0e99e15e39db-a7c4c643a519-1000--2020-gdansk-uefa-europa-league-final-identity-unveiled/|title=2020 Gdańsk UEFA Europa League final identity unveiled|publisher=[[UEFA]]|date=30 August 2019}}</ref>

===Ambassador===
The original ambassador for the Gdańsk final was former Polish international [[Andrzej Buncol]],<ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.corrieredellosport.it/news/calcio/europa-league/2019/08/30-60518424/diretta_sorteggi_europa_league_dalle_13_dove_seguirli_in_tv/|language=it |title=Sorteggi Europa League: la Roma trova il Moenchengladbach, Rennes e Celtic per la Lazio |publisher=[[Corriere dello Sport – Stadio]]|date=30 August 2019 |access-date=3 June 2020}}</ref> who won the [[1987–88 UEFA Cup]] with [[Bayer 04 Leverkusen|Bayer Leverkusen]].

===Officials===
On 18 August 2020, UEFA named Dutchman [[Danny Makkelie]] as the referee for the final. Makkelie had been a [[FIFA International Referees List|FIFA referee]] since 2011, and was previously an additional assistant referee in the [[2018 UEFA Europa League Final]] and the [[video assistant referee]] in the [[2019 UEFA Champions League Final]]. He was also an assistant video assistant referee in the [[2018 FIFA World Cup Final]]. He was joined by four of his fellow countrymen, with Mario Diks and Hessel Steegstra as assistant referees, [[Jochem Kamphuis]] as the [[video assistant referee]] and [[Kevin Blom]] as one of the assistant VAR officials. The other assistant VAR for the final was [[Paweł Gil]] from Poland, with his compatriot Tomasz Sokolnicki serving as the offside VAR official. [[Anastasios Sidiropoulos]] of Greece was the fourth official.<ref name="officials">{{cite news |url=https://www.uefa.com/news-media/news/0260-102923d796cc-d6eade3bdb66-1000/ |title=Referee team appointed for UEFA Europa League final |website=[[UEFA]] |publisher=Union of European Football Associations |date=18 August 2020 |access-date=18 August 2020}}</ref>

