*[[Penalty shoot-out (association football)|Penalty shoot-out]] if scores still level
*Twelve named substitutes
*Maximum of five substitutions, with a sixth allowed in extra time{{refn|group=note|Each team was only given three opportunities to make substitutions, with a fourth opportunity in extra time, excluding substitutions made at half-time, before the start of extra time and at half-time in extra time.}}
